{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉穎鏇（Tiffany）憑藉高挑的身材以及陽光活潑的形象，一直以來都深受廣大觀眾與網民喜愛。昨晚（8日），Tiffany 於社交平台上大派福利，分享了一輯在夜間乘搭叮叮車時所拍攝的隨性美照，展現迷人魅力。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中的 Tiffany 以一身休閒打扮示人，身穿黑色背心，外搭一件寬鬆的灰色連帽外套，下半身則配襯牛仔短褲。這身穿搭不僅完美展露了她的迷人鎖骨，更大方大晒其標誌性的長腿。在其中一張照片中，Tiffany 更任由晚風吹亂髮絲遮擋面容，忍不住可愛笑場，展現出率真自然的一面。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"61da9041-691c-4fdc-bca7-5afd056744fd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026McGX6fRaEi1789008325.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"61da9041-691c-4fdc-bca7-5afd056744fd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b52f5d67-d514-4135-873e-4d7a828807c0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266a8SyEZOes1789008324.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b52f5d67-d514-4135-873e-4d7a828807c0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這輯充滿生活氣息的唯美照片曝光後，隨即引來大批粉絲湧入留言狂讚。網民紛紛被她的甜美笑容迷倒，留言表示：「Tiffany 嘅笑容總會融化我」、「睇到人心花怒放」，更有粉絲對這畫面給予極高評價，大讚她：「簡直係夜間移動嘅風景線！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5097710a-950a-45c0-8d71-38ffe7a3b450.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20268L61znXj1B1789008324.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5097710a-950a-45c0-8d71-38ffe7a3b450.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T03:19:56.461591+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}